### D1. Everything
GET http://localhost:5056/devices

### D2. Search by name (any case, partial)
GET http://localhost:5056/devices?q=pump

### D3. Filter by category
GET http://localhost:5056/devices?category=Control

### D4. Only devices with active alerts
GET http://localhost:5056/devices?hasAlerts=true

### D5. Only devices WITHOUT alerts
GET http://localhost:5056/devices?hasAlerts=false

### D6. Filters combined
GET http://localhost:5056/devices?category=Control&hasAlerts=true

### D7. Search that matches nothing
GET http://localhost:5056/devices?q=zzz

### List all devices
GET http://localhost:5056/devices

### Raise a disconnect alert on Pump A
POST http://localhost:5056/alerts/disconnect
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sensorId": "155f258e-d52d-4c49-8938-5540dbcca402" }

### H2 (sent second, the EARLIEST time)
POST http://localhost:5056/telemetry/electrical
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sensorId": "b9fa0b31-619f-4385-b998-0972163f3a3f", "timeStamp": "2026-10-17T10:01:00Z", "value": { "watts": 6000 } }
